Release 1.3
Added

App Versioning: Integrated the application version display in the frontend, including a direct link to the changelog.
API Documentation Access: Added a direct link to the API documentation within the frontend interface.
GeoJSON Support: Implemented GeoJSON export/format support for Golden Records.
Match Quality Monitoring: New view to monitor and track the overall quality of record matching.
Enhanced Reconcile View: Added the ability to see all details of individual records within the reconcile interface.
Flexible Golden Records: Added the possibility to link to any existing golden record.
Distance-Based Scoring: Integrated distance metrics into the reconciliation scoring logic.

Fixed

Golden Record Visibility: Resolved an issue where records promoted to "golden record" status were not being displayed.

Documentation

Matching Logic: Completed technical documentation for the system's matching logic.

Release 1.2 Completed
Added

Search by Geoportal ID: Implemented the ability to search records using Geoportal identifiers.
Golden Record API: New API endpoint to retrieve all golden records.
Full Record Promotion: Capability to promote an entire record to "Golden" status.
Quality Indicators: Added quality indicators for Golden Records.
Traffic Tracking: Implemented recording and tracking for system traffic.
Source Attribute Visibility: Display of all attributes on the Sources panels.
Map Visuals: Markers on the main map now utilize Source and Layer data for better distinction.
Infrastructure: Deployed automated backup mechanisms.

Fixed

OSM Reconciliation: Fixed broken reconciliation logic for OpenStreetMap data.
Geoportail API: Corrected a typo in the Geoportail search API name.
CACLR Validity: Fixed the "Start validity date" logic on CACLR records.

Documentation

OpenAPI: Cleaned up and finalized the OpenAPI/Swagger documentation.

Release 1.1